 "description": "Creates a new subscriber when the email does not exist in the workspace. If the email already exists, the API updates the existing subscriber unless create_only is true. Effect: external-email. Retry with the same idempotency_key. Permissions: live_actions:write, subscribers:write. API reference: https://mailrith.com/developers/api-reference.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$defs": {
   "ConsentEvidence": {
